---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Website Privacy Policy | ATRIUM MEDICAL CENTER"
  description="Website Privacy Policy for ATRIUM MEDICAL CENTER in Stafford, TX."
>
  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="container text-center">
      <h1>Website Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>ATRIUM MEDICAL CENTER • Effective Date: January 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-padding">
    <div class="container policy-content">
      <h2>1. Overview</h2>
      <p>Atrium Medical Center respects your privacy and is committed to protecting your personal health and web data. This Website Privacy Policy describes how we collect, use, store, and disclose information obtained from visitors to our website (www.atriummedicalcenter.com).</p>

      <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>We may collect personal information that you voluntarily provide when filling out forms on our site, such as your full name, email address, phone number, and health inquiry details submitted through our contact or referral forms.</p>

      <h2>3. Use of Information</h2>
      <p>Information collected is used solely to respond to your inquiries, schedule hospital tours, process patient referrals, evaluate job applications, and improve our clinical healthcare services.</p>

      <h2>4. Data Security</h2>
      <p>We maintain appropriate physical, technical, and administrative safeguards to protect your personal data against unauthorized access, loss, or misuse.</p>

      <h2>5. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have questions regarding this policy, contact our privacy officer at admin@atriummedicalcenter.com or 281-207-8200.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-header { background: var(--color-surface-dark); color: var(--color-on-dark); padding: 4rem 0 3rem; text-align: center; border-bottom: 3px solid var(--color-primary); }
  .page-header h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .policy-content { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.7; }
  .policy-content h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--color-ink); margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-primary); padding-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  .policy-content p { color: var(--color-body); margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
</style>
